WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.320
Venus hides under clouds so thick no camera can see through them, so I used radar instead.

2
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:18.880
I bounced radio waves off the ground and turned the echoes into maps of volcanoes, lava plains and craters.

3
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:27.790
At the end, my team turned my solar panels like the sails of a windmill and let me fall into the clouds I had seen through.

4
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:32.610
I saw through the clouds, then became part of them.
